WEBVTT

00:02.740 --> 00:05.380
He went up ahead on his own.

00:05.860 --> 00:07.610
Seriously...

00:08.000 --> 00:11.100
He's always in such a rush
to get ahead of everyone else.

00:12.750 --> 00:16.370
Our top priorities right now
are to defeat the Dark Triad,

00:16.370 --> 00:20.940
close the gate to the Underworld, and prevent
the situation from getting any worse.

00:21.540 --> 00:26.260
To do that, we must first separate
Dante from those Supreme Devils!

00:27.090 --> 00:28.380
Slowly...

00:28.740 --> 00:31.470
Let's enjoy this slowly...

00:31.470 --> 00:32.970
Yes, let's...

00:32.970 --> 00:34.430
Torment...

00:34.430 --> 00:36.020
Toy with...

00:36.020 --> 00:37.650
Kill...

00:37.650 --> 00:39.520
Destroy...

00:39.520 --> 00:42.400
Yes...

00:46.420 --> 00:50.210
Yeah! This is it! Amazing!

00:50.210 --> 00:53.570
This is the world I wanted!

00:54.020 --> 00:55.030
Hey...

00:55.030 --> 00:57.700
Your opponent is me, dammit...!

00:58.300 --> 01:00.710
I'll definitely... cut you apart!

01:01.780 --> 01:03.460
Interesting.

01:03.980 --> 01:06.210
Jack alone may not be enough...

01:06.210 --> 01:08.750
But I'll just have to bet on him.

01:08.750 --> 01:11.300
Walgner, did you complete your mission?

01:13.120 --> 01:14.130
All right.

01:15.740 --> 01:16.900
Devil Union.

01:21.070 --> 01:22.700
Mode: Gallus.

01:23.950 --> 01:25.480
Characteristic:

01:25.890 --> 01:27.130
Call.

01:47.710 --> 01:50.740
He froze us for a moment.

01:50.740 --> 01:52.140
And he transported us.

01:52.140 --> 01:53.550
How amusing.

01:54.000 --> 01:56.390
I'll be your opponent, devils!

01:58.810 --> 01:59.970
Mana Zone:

02:02.340 --> 02:04.110
Dark Prison Hunting Ground!

02:04.730 --> 02:09.250
Now, let's begin this hellish game of tag!

02:10.449 --> 02:12.180
I can't see anything.

02:12.180 --> 02:13.900
Neither can I.

02:13.900 --> 02:15.990
Let's play with this power.

02:15.990 --> 02:20.880
Yeah, let's play.
Let's see who can kill him first.

02:20.880 --> 02:23.000
But don't get too serious.

02:23.000 --> 02:25.950
You're right.
Let's take our time.

02:25.950 --> 02:27.500
Yes, carefully.

02:27.500 --> 02:29.190
Slowly.

02:29.190 --> 02:30.460
Carefully.

02:48.980 --> 02:50.610
Mode: Equus!

02:54.910 --> 02:55.450
I knew it!

02:56.050 --> 02:58.270
Found you.

02:58.270 --> 03:00.870
My attacks don't work on them!

03:00.870 --> 03:02.700
And their magic power is bottomless!

03:03.490 --> 03:05.290
I can't even defend with Equus!

03:06.460 --> 03:08.380
That means all I can do is...

03:10.630 --> 03:13.550
Keep dodging until I die

03:13.550 --> 03:15.680
and hold them off here!

03:15.680 --> 03:17.650
So fast.

03:17.650 --> 03:18.700
But...

03:18.700 --> 03:20.320
And yet...

03:20.320 --> 03:21.220
Why?

03:21.220 --> 03:23.640
Why don't you run away?

03:26.980 --> 03:31.480
Because I'm alive to make you pay
for what you've done!

03:31.480 --> 03:34.990
And besides, I don't care...

03:34.990 --> 03:36.900
...if I die.

03:41.520 --> 03:45.750
The House of Faust, a distinguished
noble house, had twin brothers.

03:46.160 --> 03:50.930
The younger twin was a perfect gentleman,
loved by many people.

03:50.930 --> 03:55.840
He joined the Magic Knights
and saved people as a matter of course.

03:56.420 --> 03:59.010
The older twin was a delinquent
with a bad attitude,

03:59.010 --> 04:01.350
despised by most people.

04:01.810 --> 04:05.850
He used his magic however he pleased,
only for his own benefit.

04:07.360 --> 04:10.860
Aren't you going to join
the Magic Knights, brother?

04:11.460 --> 04:14.530
With your magic,
you could save a lot of people.

04:14.530 --> 04:15.860
Don't be stupid.

04:16.260 --> 04:19.339
What's so fun about that?

04:19.339 --> 04:20.950
Morgen!

04:23.280 --> 04:24.700
We've got a mission!

04:25.500 --> 04:27.020
Got it, Yami.

04:27.460 --> 04:30.020
And there's another weirdo here.

04:30.020 --> 04:33.460
How the hell did a guy like you
join the Magic Knights?

04:33.900 --> 04:36.460
That robe doesn't suit you at all.

04:36.460 --> 04:38.640
Huh? You were here?

04:38.640 --> 04:42.210
You're still acting like a delinquent?
That's embarrassing.

04:42.210 --> 04:44.900
You're pretty much the same as me, loser.

04:45.730 --> 04:47.730
You two always get along so well.

04:47.730 --> 04:49.570
How the hell does it look like that, Morgen?

04:49.570 --> 04:54.650
You better not go too crazy
and end up getting caught by us,

04:54.650 --> 04:55.810
Nacht.

04:56.500 --> 04:59.280
Right back at you, dumbass.

05:01.540 --> 05:05.180
I only wanted to do things I found fun.

05:06.180 --> 05:09.660
Ever since I was old enough to remember,
I'd done nothing but cause trouble.

05:10.100 --> 05:12.740
My little brother was the polar opposite.

05:13.170 --> 05:16.670
Everyone loved him,
and he loved everyone.

05:16.670 --> 05:19.670
He was like the light
of his own magic attribute,

05:19.670 --> 05:23.390
willing to sacrifice himself for others.

05:25.420 --> 05:27.950
Around the time I got my grimoire,

05:27.950 --> 05:31.060
I heard rumors about a foreigner
who used strange magic.

05:31.060 --> 05:33.330
And I went to see him
out of my curiosity.

05:38.150 --> 05:39.900
What's with you, punk?

05:40.980 --> 05:42.320
Wanna fight?

05:43.520 --> 05:46.460
He was quite an eccentric guy,

05:46.460 --> 05:50.500
and perhaps because our magic attributes
were similar, we got along oddly well.

05:51.280 --> 05:53.170
We started hanging out

05:53.170 --> 05:57.670
and often got up to mischief just enough to
avoid getting caught by the Magic Knights.

05:58.110 --> 05:58.920
Half a year later,

05:59.520 --> 06:02.260
by sheer coincidence,
that guy and my little brother

06:02.260 --> 06:06.050
joined the Gray Deer Brigade.

06:07.180 --> 06:12.100
I thought there was no way someone like
Yami could fit in with the Magic Knights,

06:12.100 --> 06:15.730
but my little brother treated everyone equally
and became friends with Yami, too.

06:16.380 --> 06:20.260
Maybe because of him, Yami managed
to feel at home in the brigade as well.

06:22.650 --> 06:25.900
You've got the greatest
talent for magic, brother.

06:25.900 --> 06:31.170
I was sick of being urged
to join the Magic Knights by him.

06:33.380 --> 06:36.750
When we turned 18,
my parents summoned me.

06:37.290 --> 06:40.280
Don't tell me you're gonna lecture me now?

06:40.280 --> 06:44.130
Just forget I'm the oldest son
and have Morgen inherit the family...

06:44.130 --> 06:45.140
No.

06:45.950 --> 06:49.640
You'll be the one who will
inherit the House of Faust, Nacht.

06:49.640 --> 06:50.810
Huh?

06:51.390 --> 06:52.390
Shadow Magic:

06:52.990 --> 06:55.070
Invitation From a Dark Garden.

07:01.890 --> 07:03.360
Where is this...?

07:03.360 --> 07:08.610
The House of Faust has devoted itself
to devil studies for generations.

07:08.610 --> 07:12.870
That magic and its spirit
have been passed down to you.

07:13.360 --> 07:17.880
The horrifying yet beautiful allure
of the unknown made my body tremble.

07:17.880 --> 07:22.270
My heart stirred... and I was overwhelmed
with indescribable excitement.

07:23.810 --> 07:26.300
The malice within me was rejoiced.

07:27.170 --> 07:30.680
In the Faust family, I was the one
who was truly crazy,

07:30.680 --> 07:33.040
while Morgan was the black sheep.

07:37.710 --> 07:43.440
While Morgen and Yami became a dynamic
duo of light and dark in the Magic Knights,

07:43.440 --> 07:48.020
I immersed myself in devil studies
and discovered my talent for it.

07:48.720 --> 07:52.430
To think you've contracted
with four devils in such a short time

07:52.430 --> 07:55.660
and mastered their powers to this extent...!

07:56.030 --> 07:59.020
You are a genius, Nacht.

08:00.420 --> 08:05.670
You just might be able to contract
with this devil as well!

08:06.110 --> 08:11.010
The Underworld is ruled by three
devils of gravity, time, and space.

08:11.010 --> 08:14.680
One of the devils who supports them...

08:14.680 --> 08:18.100
...is the Supreme Devil, Lucifugus!

08:18.100 --> 08:20.860
A Supreme Devil...

08:20.860 --> 08:23.730
Interesting...

08:23.730 --> 08:25.480
Stop it, brother!

08:26.180 --> 08:27.490
Morgen!

08:27.490 --> 08:30.460
Father, Mother, forbidden magic is a crime.

08:30.460 --> 08:32.740
As a Magic Knight,
I can't turn a blind eye to this!

08:33.140 --> 08:36.120
And it's dangerous!
You can't go any further!

08:36.539 --> 08:38.870
Isn't that what makes it good?

08:39.280 --> 08:42.500
A Supreme Devil...
Now that's interesting.

08:42.929 --> 08:45.900
Things need to be this thrilling!

08:45.900 --> 08:47.630
Brother...

08:47.630 --> 08:51.780
Morgen, you and I are different.

08:53.250 --> 08:56.940
I'll surpass my limits here and now!

09:02.730 --> 09:03.980
Summon.

09:13.490 --> 09:17.040
Even though his power should
be suppressed by the ritual...

09:17.500 --> 09:19.780
What is this magic power?!

09:28.530 --> 09:32.010
He's attacking everyone
besides the ritual's caster?!

09:32.820 --> 09:34.510
I can't move...!

09:35.020 --> 09:36.680
A Supreme Devil...

09:37.300 --> 09:40.030
...was something we should
never have messed with!

09:45.190 --> 09:46.610
Morgen?!

09:47.020 --> 09:49.860
Is he going to destroy
the relic connected to the devil

09:49.860 --> 09:52.000
and cancel the ritual?!

09:53.610 --> 09:55.030
No, don't...

09:55.940 --> 09:59.200
We don't know what kind of risks
could bring from this intervention!

10:13.460 --> 10:15.720
Morgen...? Morgen!

10:19.300 --> 10:23.490
I didn't report to the Magic Knights
that our family

10:23.490 --> 10:26.730
was practicing forbidden magic...

10:26.730 --> 10:28.820
I guess this is my punishment...

10:28.820 --> 10:32.740
You idiot! Why did you do this?!

10:32.740 --> 10:35.700
Because my dream was...

10:47.730 --> 10:52.560
...to stand beside you and protect
the kingdom's peace...

10:52.560 --> 10:59.160
...as knights of shadow and light.

11:01.630 --> 11:03.460
Morgen?

11:04.270 --> 11:06.820
Morgen...?

11:08.000 --> 11:10.540
He's the very picture of a good guy.

11:10.540 --> 11:13.440
So dazzling I could
barely look him in the eye.

11:13.440 --> 11:15.530
That was what you were like,

11:16.080 --> 11:19.780
and I loved you so much.

11:22.790 --> 11:25.520
I wanted you, at least,
to keep shining.

11:25.520 --> 11:30.220
I was afraid that if someone like me stood
beside you, I'd tarnish your brilliance...

11:30.930 --> 11:33.490
I'm the one who should die!

11:33.490 --> 11:36.940
Please! Save my little brother!

11:36.940 --> 11:39.550
He hasn't done anything wrong!

11:39.550 --> 11:42.180
Please, Gods!

11:42.180 --> 11:45.180
Don't you dare spout
such convenient nonsense.

11:45.730 --> 11:51.440
After doing whatever you wanted, now you
count on the gods when you're in trouble?

11:51.940 --> 11:53.960
What a damn joke, you idiot.

11:54.770 --> 11:56.990
Who in the right mind would save you?

11:56.990 --> 11:58.950
I'll never forgive myself...

11:59.640 --> 12:01.300
Until I die.

12:17.730 --> 12:20.660
Someday, I'm gonna start my own brigade.

12:21.790 --> 12:26.230
Can you imagine me as a captain?
That's hilarious, isn't it?

12:26.820 --> 12:28.620
If I make it happen...

12:31.820 --> 12:35.940
You'll be my vice-captain,
and we'll both get laughed at together.

12:39.200 --> 12:43.420
No matter how hard I try to atone,
I can't forgive myself.

12:44.020 --> 12:47.710
I won't allow myself to earn praise
or bask in the spotlight.

12:48.690 --> 12:52.710
I can never be like Morgen,
and I must never become like him.

12:53.300 --> 12:56.710
I'll destroy evil with evil
from the shadows...

12:57.260 --> 12:58.830
...until I die!

13:07.470 --> 13:11.060
I'm not trying to rectify your evil.

13:11.730 --> 13:14.730
I'm going to kill you
before you can lay a hand

13:15.180 --> 13:16.340
on any good people.

13:16.730 --> 13:21.240
Damn it... I thought I'd never
have to say this again, but...

13:23.390 --> 13:27.390
I'll surpass my limits here and now!

13:32.030 --> 13:35.940
All the devils I'm contracted with
are mid-ranking devils.

13:36.500 --> 13:40.590
They can't even touch
these Supreme Devils.

13:41.060 --> 13:45.200
I know my limits.
That's why...

13:45.900 --> 13:47.600
Help me with my bet...

13:47.600 --> 13:50.350
Plumede, Walgner.

13:50.350 --> 13:56.360
Yes. You showed us things we never
could have seen in the Underworld.

13:56.360 --> 13:58.780
You can do it, Mister Nacht.

14:02.430 --> 14:04.110
I'll surpass my limits...

14:05.950 --> 14:09.300
...here and now!

14:11.090 --> 14:12.290
Devil Union.

14:23.470 --> 14:26.600
Mode: Gallus x Felis!

14:26.930 --> 14:27.860
Oh?

14:27.860 --> 14:30.290
His magic power increased?

14:30.640 --> 14:33.260
For just a moment,

14:33.640 --> 14:37.410
I can boost the power of my magic
to the level of a Supreme Devil!

14:46.320 --> 14:49.410
Shadow Magic: Monument of Atonement.

14:50.530 --> 14:55.980
By sacrificing myself,
I'll trap you in a world of shadows

14:55.980 --> 14:58.630
with no light, life, or death!

14:59.150 --> 15:03.880
Come and play an endless,
hellish game of tag with me!

15:39.580 --> 15:46.570
Impossible...! They broke my magic
that doesn't physically exist?!

15:47.920 --> 15:49.970
Their magic...

15:50.430 --> 15:52.930
...burns everything to ashes...

15:53.870 --> 15:55.680
Devil Flame Magic.

15:55.680 --> 15:58.080
...and freezes everything.

15:58.080 --> 16:00.190
Devil Ice Magic.

16:00.620 --> 16:04.780
Even shadow and light,
and even invisible concepts...

16:37.460 --> 16:39.480
Good, good.

16:39.480 --> 16:41.150
Squeezing out...

16:41.150 --> 16:42.810
Until nothing is left...

16:42.810 --> 16:44.400
Until he's empty...

16:44.400 --> 16:46.070
Screams of agony and despair...

16:46.070 --> 16:47.490
...wrung from the straining...

16:47.490 --> 16:50.910
...throat of a human!

16:51.440 --> 16:53.870
These devils were only playing around

16:53.870 --> 16:55.950
- I can't take it anymore...
- from the very beginning...

16:55.950 --> 16:56.670
Yes.

16:56.670 --> 16:57.600
I just can't.

16:57.600 --> 16:59.700
Yes, neither can I.

16:59.700 --> 17:00.910
Let's kill him.

17:00.910 --> 17:03.210
Yes, let's kill him.

17:05.140 --> 17:11.390
Let us hear your last and finest scream.

17:11.760 --> 17:14.260
There is no human...

17:15.010 --> 17:17.200
...who could beat...

17:18.349 --> 17:19.569
...a Supreme Devil.

17:32.300 --> 17:33.700
If anything could...

17:39.790 --> 17:41.620
Huh? My hand severed?

17:42.110 --> 17:44.000
Hey, you...

17:44.460 --> 17:47.130
What do you think you're doing
to our vice captain?!

17:47.730 --> 17:49.790
...it's Anti-Magic!

17:50.130 --> 17:51.950
Mister Nacht!

17:51.950 --> 17:57.070
Please, you've gotta hang in there!
If you die, we're in trouble too!

17:57.070 --> 17:58.540
Gimodelo...

18:00.190 --> 18:04.020
You're extremely late, but now
all cards are finally on the table.

18:04.480 --> 18:06.770
Forget about me.

18:06.770 --> 18:09.420
Hurry and go defeat the Dark Triad.

18:11.840 --> 18:14.110
Don't say something like that!

18:14.540 --> 18:17.870
I got stronger because all of you.

18:17.870 --> 18:21.290
You have to live
and witness that strength!

18:23.630 --> 18:28.780
Was I hoping a new morning would dawn?

18:29.540 --> 18:34.180
You're both good people,
but you're nothing like him.

18:34.750 --> 18:37.930
We've never had this much fun...

18:37.930 --> 18:41.680
...in the hundreds of years
we've spent in the Underworld!

18:42.980 --> 18:46.100
Who'd have thought I'd run
into you two in this world.

18:46.100 --> 18:50.860
Lilith and Naamah, the Supreme Devils!

18:50.860 --> 18:52.400
More...

18:52.400 --> 18:55.070
Entertain us some more!

19:25.730 --> 19:27.310
I wonder if I can hit him...

19:27.310 --> 19:29.400
Swing your sword again and again.

19:29.400 --> 19:31.400
Can I hit him?

19:31.400 --> 19:33.400
Can I?

19:41.990 --> 19:43.550
Which of us will hit him first?

19:43.550 --> 19:45.540
Can we hit him?

19:45.540 --> 19:48.920
Can we kill him?

19:48.920 --> 19:50.920
Third Sword:

19:51.420 --> 19:52.920
Demon-Destroyer!

20:20.290 --> 20:24.660
What a shame.
He got you first, Naamah.

20:26.510 --> 20:30.920
But now, we really will be
able to play together.

20:38.930 --> 20:41.430
What...?!

20:48.270 --> 20:54.270
We can't wait to hear
the scream of the perfect prey.

20:54.270 --> 20:57.650
Their power is more than
just one plus one!

20:58.080 --> 21:01.410
Their magic power is so massive
that I feel like I'm going crazy!

21:02.910 --> 21:05.300
You're probably insanely powerful and all,

21:05.300 --> 21:08.210
but I can't sense magic,
so I have no idea!

21:21.900 --> 21:26.520
Then let us show you.

21:29.810 --> 21:31.840
Dammit...!

21:34.860 --> 21:39.070
Even if you survive,
everyone else will die.

21:39.490 --> 21:43.490
That hurts, doesn't it?

21:43.490 --> 21:44.910
Now...

21:48.300 --> 21:50.080
Grieve.

21:52.080 --> 21:54.080
All you did was get bigger!

21:54.460 --> 21:57.220
So I'll get bigger too!

22:00.420 --> 22:03.410
First Sword:

22:03.410 --> 22:07.010
Demon-Slayer!

22:09.840 --> 22:11.890
Hey, come on...

22:11.890 --> 22:16.960
Just how damn big are you planning to get?

23:44.820 --> 23:55.890
PAGE 174: DAY OF ATONEMENT
